    "exp96b": "Controlled synthetic K=6 nonlinear quadrant+radial recurring bandit testbed (A1->B1->C->A2->B2_silent, T=300, 60 steps/phase), evaluated live against the hosted Adapt-1 API alongside 8 deterministic offline online bandit peers.",
